    "text": "WALA-TV FOX10\nwebsite\nBatesville\nWoman dies after crashing her vehicle into Walmart garden center, police say\nBy Jordan Gartner,\n1 days agoBATESVILLE, Ark. (KAIT/Gray News) - A woman died in Arkansas after she crashed her car into a Walmart garden center. According to Batesville Police Department Cpl. Stephen Schlotzhauer, an elderly woman was driving last Friday near the supermarket when she hit a curb and swerved to avoid hitting a parked vehicle.",
